    "body": "Progress (local commits on `issue/3767-solidcore-bump`, not pushed yet):\n\n- The fork `NeoTech/solidcore` `main` took 300 upstream commits by a fast-forward (merge-upstream). The fork is now equal to `tangency-labs/solidcore` `main` at `fa67b3f560b7a8d59e99cb728f72f85e91dee2da`.\n- `crates/kernel/Cargo.toml` pins the six solidcore crates at that rev. `Cargo.lock` changes only for these six packages. No new package.\n- The bump moved five pins. Each file is still refused or still measured exactly. The new parser density limit made `step_diag` refuse a legal dense record; the fix is in `step_diag::record_parses`.\n- Follow-up: #3800 (no test reaches `MeshRefusal::Lenient` now).\n- Next: the release run of the fig8 heavy tests and of the #2849 known-fail test.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
